summary: IPACTA CA basic + host pki-cli
description: |
  FreeIPA-only IPACTA install (from freeipa tests/tmt/ca-basic-test) plus
  host-side pki-cli smoke. Container still verifies packaged IPACTA drop-ins
  (`/usr/bin/pki` shim). Host uses venv `pki-cli` from this repo.

  Host `pki-cli info` is expected to exit 2 (Java MainCLI gated / java-bound)
  until pure-Python REST is implemented.
test: ./test.sh
framework: shell
require: []
duration: 180m
tag:
    - ca
    - ipacta
    - pki-cli
    - idm-8254
link:
    - verifies: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/IDM-8254
    - relates: https://github.com/agaragna77/pki-cli
